*__pycache__*
old/
logs/
*.vscode*
data/
# Derived artefacts.
# The measurement data lives outside the checkout (~/clouds_data) and is never versioned.
# These are intermediate products of the scripts under experiments/: match and motion
# dumps, run cluster logs and profiler output. They are large (166 MB of .npz alone) and
# every one is regenerable by re-running its script against the measurement data, so they
# do not belong in the history. The small .json results ARE the evidence and are kept.
*.npz
*.jsonl
*.prof
*.pyc
